@base = http://localhost:8083

### Post a comment
POST {{base}}/articles/europe/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Jane Doe",
  "body": "What a lovely story about the kittens."
}

### Post a comment with profanity — NOT filtered yet
POST {{base}}/articles/europe/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "John Smith",
  "body": "Damn, what a hell of a good story!"
}

### Get comments for that article
GET {{base}}/articles/europe/1/comments

### Get comments for a different article — should be empty
GET {{base}}/articles/asia/1/comments